	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t02r0201_middlewoman1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>サンヨウの　みつごがね
よく　２ばんどうろに　でむくのよ▼
で　トレーナーたちと　ポケモンを
きそわせてるから　みんな　つよいよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T07:16:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>サンヨウの　三つ子がね
よく　２番道路に　出向くのよ▼
で　トレーナーたちと　ポケモンを
競わせてるから　みんな　強いよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T07:17:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-14T08:51:08" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>おばさん１</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
